        "original_id": "24944d0b-e465-5ff4-94d2-44b67688adc3",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Ben Stein, Charles Russell, Bob Engelman, Mike Werb, Mary Alice Stephenson, VJ Logan\n- Works: Ferris Bueller's Day Off, The Mask, Son of the Mask, America's Most Smartest Model\n- Organizations: Dark Horse Comics\n- Roles: hosts, director, producer, writer, winner\n\nFacts:\n- Ben Stein appeared as the economics teacher in Ferris Bueller's Day Off in 1986.\n- VJ Logan was born in 1986.\n- The Mask is a 1994 American superhero fantasy comedy film.\n- Charles Russell directed The Mask.\n- Bob Engelman produced The Mask.\n- Mike Werb wrote The Mask.\n- The Mask was based on a comic series of the same name distributed by Dark Horse Comics.\n- Ben Stein played Dr. Arthur Neuman in The Mask in 1994.\n- Ben Stein played Dr. Arthur Neuman in Son of the Mask in 2005.\n- Ben Stein and Mary Alice Stephenson were the hosts of America's Most Smartest Model.\n- VJ Logan is an American model.\n- VJ Logan won the reality competition television program America's Most Smartest Model.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
